{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_title", "source_sha256": "a3f6c331f02afbc1ad3668a5e531e20b055bb4a96cc268da09e9ec746b79ca0b", "ja": "いっぱいの、いっぱいを。", "zh": "满满的，全部献给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3c1f59f57049dadf8d0f647b9605c4baf7be4c50ec4cf8340d208b5a343f4314", "ja": "律子はセンター公演の企画を引き受けたが、\nうまく内容を決めることができない。\n美奈子達は律子をリフレッシュさせるべく、\n街を散策。プロデューサーも駆けつけ、\n律子と、公演への互いの想いを交わした。", "zh": "律子接下了C位公演的企划，\n却迟迟定不下演出的具体内容。\n为了帮律子转换心情，美奈子等人\n拉着她到街上散步。制作人也赶了过去，\n与律子交流了彼此对公演的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1000_009rit", "source_sha256": "0e7e7bb03e416e608c2b255a52c5608fe6cb77239ff774cf72d764aa5f75899d", "ja": "はぁー。楽だわ。みんなで手分けしてやってもらうと、\nステージの本番って、こんなに気楽なのねー。", "zh": "哈啊——真轻松。大家分工合作的话，原来舞台正式演出也能这么悠闲啊——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9efa3a9eb3f755d3b7170d48e5be643f88933bd9520408931be5ed7513af3841", "ja": "うまく回ってるみたいだな。進行を劇場のみんなに\n任せるって律子が言い出した時は、驚いたけど……。", "zh": "看来进展得很顺利。律子说要把流程交给剧场的大家负责时，我还吓了一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "9a6ecf03c7f83971524d66fee636e143a378ea659755e0a61bcf5018405f2895", "ja": "おかげさまで。自分の出番に専念できました。\n……持つべきは頼れる仲間、ですね。", "zh": "托您的福，我能专心准备自己的演出。\n……有值得依靠的伙伴，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "a6d27df9d8834ca57528bc16219c17c5dc2ebdb9738976b1a8b4c03530c6aa0d", "ja": "律子さーん！\n限定品のお弁当とお茶、完売間近です！", "zh": "律子姐——！\n限定便当和茶，马上就要卖光了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "7dec5815a838ce876a4c6238fa4de97e878179ede7df0c0b0653b0fa537df6d4", "ja": "売店グッズも、新製品の\nスーパー律子さん人形が大好評だよ♪", "zh": "小卖部的周边也是，新品的\n超级律子玩偶非常受欢迎哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "81e0b18d3d341d5e67efd5b96a636d52fc9b2f8aff6d3e938b7d5937a65b0222", "ja": "ありがとう！　その調子でバンバン売って\n稼いでちょうだい。事務所が潤うわ。ふふふ……。", "zh": "谢谢！就照这个势头多卖点，赚大钱吧。这样事务所就能宽裕些了。呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "a6b81c40faa7374b2f0d4914a3c477226e551c6733cae7bb6877e84f6334aa04", "ja": "でもさ、律っちゃんウソツキだよ。レッスン簡単とか\n言って結局、地獄の特訓したじゃん？　ヒドイなー。", "zh": "可是啊，律子姐你骗人。说什么训练很简单，结果最后却是地狱特训，不是吗？太过分了——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "69a193e56e5f339c967314db46968f464271fde6a95b3e032571bb9953106a62", "ja": "それはあなた達が、私を本気にさせたからでしょ。\nもっと厳しい特訓をお望み？", "zh": "那是因为你们让我认真起来了吧。还想要更严格的特训吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "7f46fff2cf462b528a05bda4cd02d83fee5963f8156f3d08906d0a720e230895", "ja": "いえ、軍曹！　ううん……今日は優雅でヨユーな\nリツコお嬢さんってカンジかな。それとも、リツコ姫？", "zh": "不，长官！不对……今天更像是优雅又游刃有余的\n律子大小姐吧。还是说，该叫律子公主？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "aff7cd164200bf201bfb621bc530d78a511d0047565efa9c14ced30ab6c276cd", "ja": "律子さん！　そろそろ第二部のステージ、スタンバイ\nお願いします！　セトリの確認も、こちらで……。", "zh": "律子小姐！差不多该到第二部的舞台候场了，\n拜托您了！歌单的确认也请在这边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "2b57cf2b9fb6ce27bf53f3d658f37e72ea6942027b65875f542fd3f93c15c5d0", "ja": "了解。みんな、行きましょうか。\nそれじゃ、またあとで。{$P$}。", "zh": "明白了。大家，我们走吧。\n那么，待会儿见。{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cc8854ee7842d77affb40b11a77b4c8378daf136ffb6f70893c2debc63273788", "ja": "ああ。頼んだぞ、みんな……\nあ、律子、ちょっと待った。", "zh": "嗯，拜托大家了……\n啊，律子，等一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "0dd7e09088de0af8e79f0fb79276361caf306ab99720285e65f589b5deeebd8c", "ja": "っと、と。どうかしました？", "zh": "等等。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0a953b22d2ea19e8ddf6585910c5fa28b9d71108eeb544b0b2aea7a81139ee3f", "ja": "さっきのソロステージ、盛り上がったよな。\nリクエストしてよかったよ。最高だった。だから……。", "zh": "刚才的个人舞台，气氛很热烈啊。\n能提出那个请求真是太好了。太棒了。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fa16120f99569250f14eebecfd9ed00f6dd994da3cff419d5f3e18189c923ed1", "ja": "これからも、あの調子でいこう！", "zh": "接下来也保持那个状态吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "94952e4a93c9d48f59907f2ddde908010425c27d444cb8390206e35c002d327d", "ja": "……。ふふっ、ありがとうございます。\nそうですね、これからも……。", "zh": "……。呵呵，谢谢您。\n是啊，今后也要……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "feac28e217ac59b735a885100d219dcd94fe3c4e27540d677be58dfa72c262b0", "ja": "いっぱいいっぱい、頑張ります！", "zh": "我会竭尽全力，拼命加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5c1b5ca4080e77c99eb63d040a52313fa2d886852679d25e2632ec950a044e0a", "ja": "（律子は仲間と共に、新たな舞台に向かう。\n拍手と歓声の待つ、眩しいスポットライトのもとへ）", "zh": "（律子和伙伴们一起，正朝着新的舞台前进。\n向着等待着掌声与欢呼的耀眼聚光灯而去。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_066_1018_p", "source_sha256": "100181a692a97c63d508a4b4686806437fe5b27af2683d3936554d65fc17c4da", "ja": "（劇場はみんなでこれからも、作り続けるもの。\n俺もプロデューサーとして、ずっと応援を続けよう）", "zh": "（剧场是今后也要由大家一起不断建设的地方。\n我也会作为制作人，一直支持大家。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
